              "y": 153,
              "name": "2ndとは",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r2cLqT",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "2nd とは",
                  "fill": "#ffffffff",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                  "width": 130,
                  "height": 18,
                  "content": "2nd とは",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "krnUQ",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 31,
                  "name": "2ndは、東京都内を中心に、不動産事業、リフォーム事業を営む企業です。 新しい価値・新しい環境を生み出す企業を目指しております。",
                  "fill": "#ffffffff",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                  "width": 495,
